@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 160
title Native picker - mixed selection
actor Teacher
participant "Owning native form" as Form
participant "Embedded browser" as Browser
participant "Repository / draft_scope" as Scope
database "Native files / attribution" as Files
Teacher -> Form : Open Folder Edit or activity Settings
Form -> Scope : Bind actual native field and limits
Teacher -> Form : Import materials
Form -> Browser : Native picker embeds scoped browser
Teacher -> Browser : Filter, browse and select cards
Teacher -> Browser : Choose destination / folder mode; review
Browser -> Scope : Validate current authority and selection
Scope -> Files : Read authorized sources and draft snapshots
Scope --> Browser : Decisions and review digest
Teacher -> Browser : Import reviewed materials
Browser -> Scope : Native chooser callback and protected download
Scope -> Files : Recheck; copy batch transactionally
Scope --> Form : Native draft response / filemanager refresh
alt Save
 Teacher -> Form : Native Save
 Form -> Files : Core permanent module save
else Cancel
 Teacher -> Form : Native Cancel
 note over Form, Files : Saved activity content remains unchanged
end
@enduml
